@baseUrl = https://localhost:7142
@token = REPLACE_WITH_JWT

### Public Course Catalog (Anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lms/catalog

### List Grading Systems
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lms/grading-systems
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Grading System
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lms/grading-systems
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Certification Pass/Fail",
  "scales": [
    { "name": "Distinction", "thresholdPercentage": 90, "isPassing": true },
    { "name": "Pass", "thresholdPercentage": 70, "isPassing": true },
    { "name": "Needs Review", "thresholdPercentage": 0, "isPassing": false }
  ]
}

### List Learning Programs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lms/programs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Facilitator Grading Queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lms/grading-queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
